<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-CRA says Norzink zinc output rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-CRA says Norzink zinc output rises.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Norzink AS produced 135,000 tonnes of zinc in 1996, up from 130,800 tonnes in 1995, RTZ Corp Plc -CRA Ltd said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Norzink earlier this month said the production target for 1997 is about 138,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>Norzinc is a 50-50 joint venture between RTZ-CRA and Trelleborg AB.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
